{
  "name": "Telegram AI assistant (Agent + memory + tools)",
  "meta": {
    "description": "A Telegram bot with a brain: an AI Agent (Gemini) that remembers each chat and can check the weather and calculate. Works without a public URL."
  },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Telegram Trigger",
      "type": "flowforge.telegramTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "message"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "name": "AI Agent",
      "type": "flowforge.aiAgent",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        300,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "={{ $json.text || 'Hello' }}",
        "systemMessage": "You are a friendly assistant. Answer in the language of the user, in a few short sentences. Use the get_weather tool for any question about the weather or what to wear, and the calculator tool for any calculation. If a tool fails, say so honestly. You are talking on Telegram: plain text only, no Markdown."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model",
      "name": "Gemini Chat Model",
      "type": "flowforge.geminiChatModel",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        165,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": "default"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "name": "Simple Memory",
      "type": "flowforge.simpleMemory",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        315,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "sessionKey": "={{ $json.chatId }}",
        "contextWindow": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "weather",
      "name": "Weather Tool",
      "type": "flowforge.weatherTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        465,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "calc",
      "name": "Calculator",
      "type": "flowforge.calculatorTool",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        615,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "reply",
      "name": "Reply",
      "type": "flowforge.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        720,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "sendMessage",
        "chatId": "={{ $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.chatId }}",
        "text": "={{ $json.output }}",
        "parseMode": "none"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note",
      "name": "How to use",
      "type": "flowforge.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -340
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Telegram AI assistant\n1. **Credentials**: add a **Telegram Bot** credential (token from @BotFather) and a **Google Gemini API** credential (key from aistudio.google.com/apikey). Or set `TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN` and `GEMINI_API_KEY` in `.env`.\n2. Switch the workflow to **Active**.\n3. In Telegram, open your bot, press **Start** and ask: *What is the weather in Paris? Should I take an umbrella?* then *And in Tokyo?* (it remembers the topic).\n4. Open an execution to see what the agent did: the model, the memory and each tool show their own runs.\n\nUse this bot only in FlowForge (one reader per bot).",
        "width": 640,
        "height": 280,
        "color": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Telegram Trigger": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "AI Agent": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Reply",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Gemini Chat Model": {
      "ai_languageModel": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_languageModel",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Simple Memory": {
      "ai_memory": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_memory",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Weather Tool": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Calculator": {
      "ai_tool": [
        [
          {
            "node": "AI Agent",
            "type": "ai_tool",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {}
}
